class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.20<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">September 18, 2013<br/>Summer Update 2013 Part 2</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Spike\">The Spike</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Spike\">The Spike</a> creatures.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Explorer%20Outfits\">Cave Explorer Outfits</a> and addons:<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Cave Explorer Male Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Cave_Explorer_Male_Addon_3_4118f8.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Cave Explorer Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Cave_Explorer_Female_Addon_3_c760c4.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Completionist\">Cave Completionist</a> achievement.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h2>\n<ul><li>100 <a href=\"#/quest/spike-tasks-quest\">fame points</a> within <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Spike\">The Spike construct</a>. You can check your current amount of fame points by asking <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnommander\">Gnommander</a> about <b>reward</b> and then checking your questlog.</li>\n<li>6,000 gp</li>\n<li>Level 50+ for the First Addon (Headware)</li>\n<li>Level 80+ for the Second Addon (Grappling Hook)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Base_Outfit\">Base Outfit</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Cave Explorer Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Cave_Explorer_Male_532682.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Cave Explorer Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Cave_Explorer_Female_3ad2b3.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>Go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnommander\">Gnommander</a>, say <b>worthy</b> and ask for the <b>basic</b> outfit to buy it for 1,000 gp.\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nGnommander: Hi there! Welcome to the <b>spike</b>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>worthy</b><br/>\nGnommander: You can acquire the <b>basic</b> outfit for 1000 gold, the <b>first</b> addon for 2000 gold and the <b>second</b> addon for 3000 gold. Which do you want to buy?.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>basic</b><br/>\nGnommander: Do you want to buy the basic outfit for 1000 gold?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nGnommander: Here it is.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cave Explorer Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"w-Addon_1_.28Headware.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Addon_1_(Headware)\">Addon 1 (Headware)</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Cave Explorer Male Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Cave_Explorer_Male_Addon_1_533396.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Cave Explorer Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Cave_Explorer_Female_Addon_1_b17df1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>Go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnommander\">Gnommander</a>, say <b>worthy</b> and ask for the <b>first</b> addon to buy it for 2,000 gp.\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>worthy</b><br/>\nGnommander: You can acquire the <b>basic</b> outfit for 1000 gold, the <b>first</b> addon for 2000 gold and the <b>second</b> addon for 3000 gold. Which do you want to buy?.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>first</b><br/>\nGnommander: Do you want to buy the second addon for 2000 gold?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nGnommander: Here it is.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cave Explorer Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"w-Addon_2_.28Grappling_Hook.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Addon_2_(Grappling_Hook)\">Addon 2 (Grappling Hook)</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Cave Explorer Male Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Cave_Explorer_Male_Addon_2_a17501.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Cave Explorer Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Cave_Explorer_Female_Addon_2_d7fb98.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>Go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnommander\">Gnommander</a>, say <b>worthy</b> and ask for the <b>second</b> addon to buy it for 3,000 gp.\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>worthy</b><br/>\nGnommander: You can acquire the <b>basic</b> outfit for 1000 gold, the <b>first</b> addon for 2000 gold and the <b>second</b> addon for 3000 gold. Which do you want to buy?.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>second</b><br/>\nGnommander: Do you want to buy the second addon for 3000 gold?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nGnommander: Here it is.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nGnommander: Good bye <i>Player</i> and take care.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cave Explorer Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Achievement\">Achievement</span></h2>\n<p>Besides the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Explorer%20Outfits\">Cave Explorer Outfits</a> you will also achieve the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Completionist\">Cave Completionist</a> achievement after completing this quest.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>","quests":["spike-tasks-quest"]}